## 📁 Project Directory Layout

```text
tax_consultant_site/
├── core/                       # Primary application: Views, Forms, Models & Routes
│   ├── admin.py                # Customized Django Admin panel
│   ├── forms.py                # Regex form validation rules
│   ├── models.py               # ContactSubmission lead data model
│   ├── urls.py                 # Core routing configurations
│   └── views.py                # View handlers and email hooks
├── static/                     # Static assets directory
│   └── core/
│       ├── css/style.css       # Design system & responsive layout
│       └── js/main.js          # Calculators & interactive JS modules
├── templates/                  # Frontend HTML templates
│   ├── 404.html                # Custom 404 Page Not Found
│   ├── 500.html                # Custom 500 Server Error
│   └── core/                   # Base, index, about, calculator, contact, thank_you
├── tax_consultant_site/        # Project settings & WSGI configuration
├── .env                        # Local environment variables (Ignored by Git)
├── .gitignore                  # Git tracking exclusion rules
├── manage.py                   # Django CLI management utility
├── Procfile                    # WSGI launch command for Gunicorn
└── requirements.txt            # Minimal production build dependencies
